				 B.TRNUSR AS TRNUSR,
				 B.STRUTY AS STRUTY,
				 B.SMEAKY AS SMEAKY,
				 B.SUOMKY AS SUOMKY,
				 B.QTSPUM AS QTSPUM,
				 B.SDUOKY AS SDUOKY,
				 B.QTSDUM AS QTSDUM,
